<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>开启后，微信键盘的语音按钮在任意 App 内都直接走「键盘扩展内录音→识别→回填」，不再整屏跳回主 App（配合动画隐藏做到“看不出跳”）。</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>语音免跳转</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.wxkbd.nojump</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>wxkbdNoJumpEnabled</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用免跳转</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>强制微信输入法语音“录音待机模式”=悬浮窗，注销/重启后也常开，无需手动再开。关闭即恢复系统原值（可切回通知栏模式）。</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>强制常开悬浮窗</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.wxkbd.nojump</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>wxkbdForceFloating</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>强制悬浮窗模式</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>微信键盘免跳转</string>
</dict>
</plist>
